§ `Order 11, Rule 12 -- inspection of original of document produced`
-- ===========================================================================

-- src:1175 | 12. —(1) If a party requests to inspect the original of any document produced, the party who produced the document must arrange a mutually convenient time and place for the inspection to take place. (2) Such inspection must take place within 14 days after the request unless the parties otherwise agree.
@ref O 11 r 12(1) (src:1175)
GIVEN `a party requests to inspect the original of a document produced` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 11 r 12(1) the party who produced the document must arrange a time and place for the inspection` MEANS
    IF `a party requests to inspect the original of a document produced`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "If a party requests to inspect the original of any document produced" fails [marginal-a]

-- src:1175 | 12. —(1) If a party requests to inspect the original of any document produced, the party who produced the document must arrange a mutually convenient time and place for the inspection to take place. (2) Such inspection must take place within 14 days after the request unless the parties otherwise agree.
@ref O 11 r 12(1) (src:1175)
GIVEN `the time and place arranged are mutually convenient` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 11 r 12(1) the arrangement is as required` MEANS
    IF `the time and place arranged are mutually convenient`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "must arrange a mutually convenient time and place for the inspection to take place" (a "must" not met, fork F-must in NOTES.md) [marginal-c]

-- src:1175 | 12. —(1) If a party requests to inspect the original of any document produced, the party who produced the document must arrange a mutually convenient time and place for the inspection to take place. (2) Such inspection must take place within 14 days after the request unless the parties otherwise agree.
